  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE RAILWAY RESTRUCTURING AND PRIVATIZATION PROJECT (RRPP) WILL HAVE SIX COMPONENTS: (I) STAFF RETRENCHMENT AND RATIONALIZATION;(II) CON- CESSIONING OF RAILWAYS INFRASTRUCTURE  &amp;  OPERATIONS; (III) CONSULTANCY STUDIES; (IV) TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE; (V) STAFF TRAINING; (VI) COUNSE- LING AND ASSISTANCE TO RETRENCHED STAFF, AND (VII) INFRASTRUCTURE RE- HABILITATION.  FINANCING REQUIREMENT IS ABOUT US$160 MILLION INCLUDING THE INVESTMENTS THAT CAN BE EXPECTED FROM THE PRIVATE INVESTORS.</narrative>
  </description>
